      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for packers and movers from bettiah to ghaziabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When planning a major relocation from Bettiah to Ghaziabad, understanding the statutory transit paperwork and risk coverage is essential for a seamless move. Beyond the physical labor, the administrative and legal frameworks ensure that your belongings are protected and compliant with national transport regulations.</p>
<p>For residents in areas like Shalimar Garden or Indirapuram, engaging reputable <strong>movers and packers in shalimar garden ghaziabad</strong> or <strong>packers and movers in ghaziabad indirapuram</strong> begins with transparency in documentation.</p>

<p>The foundation of any interstate move is the GST e-Way Bill. Under GST regulations, the movement of goods worth more than ₹50,000 requires an e-Way bill, generated on the GST portal. This digital document acts as a compliance checkpoint for transport authorities, preventing unnecessary delays at check posts.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Simultaneously, the Lorry Receipt (LR), also known as a Bilty, serves as the contract between the shipper and the carrier.</p>
